    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I am preparing for a meeting with a new raw material supplier here in Munich for our manufacturing plant. We need to draft a master service agreement (MSA) to secure our supply chain. Can you provide a checklist of standard terms and conditions we should include to protect us against supply chain volatility and sudden price fluctuations?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You should include specific clauses addressing territory-based pricing, adequacy of production slots based on demand, and liability caps on supplier conduct to manage volatility. Additionally, requiring the supplier to maintain a financial liability waiver and independent reserve inventory will help safeguard against sudden price fluctuations. Finally, ensure the contract mandates a dedicated Legal Counsel Insurance Program to ensure all assigned rights are properly protected.",
      "source": "target",
