      "content": "that makes sense. i guess i'm just looking for more than just the legal stuff. sometimes these small, unpredictable issues that pop up out of nowhere can really mess things up. are there any other ways to deal with those kinds of \"nuisance\" risks that might try to undermine our operations?",
